#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install the development version of Qiskit."
msgstr "Ketahui cara memasang versi pembangunan Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit SDK from source"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit SDK dari sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit SDK from source {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-source}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit SDK dari sumber {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install the Qiskit SDK from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the Qiskit code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Memasang Qiskit SDK dari sumber membolehkan anda mengakses versi pembangunan semasa, berbanding menggunakan versi dalam repositori Python Package Index (PyPI). Ini membolehkan anda memeriksa dan melanjutkan versi terkini kod Qiskit dengan lebih cekap.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"
msgstr "Cipta dan aktifkan persekitaran maya baharu {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke direktori projek anda dan cipta persekitaran minimal yang hanya mengandungi Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Rust compiler {#install-the-rust-compiler}"
msgstr "Pasang pengkompil Rust {#install-the-rust-compiler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Rust compiler must be installed on your system to compile Qiskit. To install the Rust compiler, use the cross-platform Rust installer [`rustup`](https://rustup.rs/) or [another install method](https://forge.rust-lang.org/infra/other-installation-methods.html).\n"
msgstr "Pengkompil Rust mesti dipasang pada sistem anda untuk mengkompil Qiskit. Untuk memasang pengkompil Rust, gunakan pemasang Rust merentas platform [`rustup`](https://rustup.rs/) atau [kaedah pemasangan lain.](https://forge.rust-lang.org/infra/other-installation-methods.html)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit:\n"
msgstr "Ikut langkah-langkah ini untuk memasang Qiskit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit repository.\n"
msgstr "Klon repositori Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit` directory.\n"
msgstr "Tukar ke direktori `qiskit`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements.\n"
msgstr "(Pilihan) Jika anda ingin menjalankan ujian atau semakan linting, pasang keperluan pembangun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit`.\n"
msgstr "Pasang `qiskit`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Pemasangan standard**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Mod boleh sunting**: Dalam mod ini, anda tidak perlu memasang semula Qiskit apabila ada perubahan kod pada projek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations. This affects the runtime performance of the compiled code. To build the compiled extensions with optimizations enabled, run the following command to rebuild the binary in _release mode_:\n"
msgstr "    Dalam mod boleh sunting, sambungan yang dikompil dibina dalam _mod nyahpepijat_ tanpa pengoptimuman. Ini mempengaruhi prestasi runtime kod yang dikompil. Untuk membina sambungan yang dikompil dengan pengoptimuman diaktifkan, jalankan arahan berikut untuk membina semula binari dalam _mod keluaran_:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    python setup.py build_rust --release --inplace\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    python setup.py build_rust --release --inplace\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    If you are working on Rust code in Qiskit, you need to rebuild the extension code every time you make a local change. In editable mode, the Rust extension is only built when the install command is run, so local changes you make to the Rust code are not reflected in the installed package unless you rebuild the extension by rerunning `build_rust` (with or without `--release`, depending on whether you want to build in release or debug mode).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    Jika anda sedang mengerjakan kod Rust dalam Qiskit, anda perlu membina semula kod sambungan setiap kali anda membuat perubahan setempat. Dalam mod boleh sunting, sambungan Rust hanya dibina apabila arahan pasang dijalankan, jadi perubahan setempat yang anda buat pada kod Rust tidak tercermin dalam pakej yang dipasang melainkan anda membina semula sambungan dengan menjalankan semula `build_rust` (dengan atau tanpa `--release`, bergantung pada sama ada anda ingin membina dalam mod keluaran atau nyahpepijat).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to the open-source Qiskit SDK.\n"
"  - [Run your first quantum circuit](/guides/quick-start).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  - Baca [garis panduan penyumbang](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) untuk menyumbang kepada Qiskit SDK sumber terbuka.\n"
"  - [Jalankan litar kuantum pertama anda](/guides/quick-start).\n"
"  - Cuba tutorial, seperti [Algoritma Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
